NGmerge

Copyright (C) 2017 John M. Gaspar (jsh58@wildcats.unh.edu)

Version 0.5 - Nov 6, 2025
  * `-r` mode to perform only validation of fastq files
  * more informative error messages for poorly formatted input files
  * `-x <int>` argument to remove reads shorter than a given length;
      default value of 1 means that zero-length reads are removed

Version 0.4 - Mar 16, 2025
  * Multiple input files must be comma-separated (not space-separated
      in quotes, as was previously allowed)

Version 0.3 - Mar 18, 2020
  * `-t <char>` option for an alternative read header delimiter
  * Various debugs, documentation edits

Version 0.2 - Nov 14, 2017
  * Fix data race in alignments output
  * Combine merged sequence functions for default and fastq-join modes

Version 0.1 - Oct 11, 2017
  * First public release on GitHub
    (based on stitch in AmpliconTools [github.com/jsh58/AmpliconTools]
      and stitch v0.8 [github.com/jsh58/stitch])
